From 44c2d69cea08b90641b42ed60cc265f165ac3af3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 11:16:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Expand driving safety: trip metrics, event history, score
 bands, idle time

- Track idle time per trip (autoTripEngine/autoTripStorage) and persist to
  new vehicle_trips.idle_seconds column
- Weekly safety summary now includes trip metrics (distance, trips, driving
  hours, idle time, avg/max speed, night/weekend trip counts), a raw event
  history list, and color-coded score bands (green/yellow/orange/red)
- Owner card gains the weekly trend row and event history; driver tips now
  quantify improvement/regression vs last week
- Weekly TrustScore cron previously only adjusted drivers with a
  driving_events row in the window, so a perfectly clean week (zero events)
  was skipped entirely and never got the clean-driving bonus -- now unions
  in drivers who completed a trip that week
